## AI MODELS

### Model 1: Ge'ez OCR
- Architecture: CNN (feature extractor) + BiLSTM + CTC loss
- Input: 32×128px grayscale
- Output: Ge'ez character sequence
- File: src/ocr/model.py (GeezOCRModel class)
- Charset: 381 Ge'ez characters + BLANK + UNK = 383 tokens
- Status: training pipeline ready, dataset downloading

### Model 2: LLM Text Restoration
- Model: Qwen2.5-1.5B (fine-tuned via Unsloth+QLoRA on Google Colab)
- Inference: LM Studio (local) or Ollama fallback
- Input: damaged Ge'ez text with [MISSING] tokens
- Output: restored text + English translation
- File: src/ocr/llm_restoration.py
- Status: not yet fine-tuned

### Model 3: Artefact Classifier
- Architecture: MobileNetV2 (transfer learning)
- Classes: pottery, stone_carving, coin, inscription_fragment, other
- File: src/object_detection/detector.py (ArtefactClassifier class)
- Status: not trained, no images collected yet

### Model 4: YOLOv8 Nano
- Used for artefact type ID after contour detection finds positions
- File: src/object_detection/detector.py (YOLOArtefactClassifier)
- Status: not trained, falls back to COCO pretrained

### Model 5: Crack Detector
- Pure OpenCV, no ML, no training needed
- File: src/crack_detection/detector.py
- Status: code written, not tested on real images

