## THINGS TO NEVER DO

- Never suggest Raspberry Pi — too expensive in Ethiopia, not in the build
- Never suggest CUDA or GPU acceleration — laptop has no discrete GPU
- Never use rocker-bogie suspension — already decided on 4-wheel
  passive differential (Leo Rover style)
- Never use raw serial.write() — always ArduinoSerial.send_command()
- Never hardcode file paths — always use config.py constants
- Never use localStorage or browser storage in any web UI artifacts
- Never suggest cloud inference — all AI runs locally on the laptop
- Never use multiprocessing in DataLoaders (num_workers=0 always)
